== Qin, Chen & Li (2023) — Error Statistics and Scalability of QEM Formulas @qin_error_2023

Studies how residual error scales with circuit size $N$. Before mitigation: $O(epsilon N)$; after optimised mitigation: $O(epsilon' sqrt(N))$. Proposes Importance Clifford Sampling (ICS) for efficient training circuit generation.

